,{\"children\":\"Why are you paying for a database that isn’t being used?\"}]]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your database setup isn’t just production - it includes development, testing, and staging environments too. These non-production databases don’t run continuously. But on provisioned platforms, even the smallest instance runs 24/7. You pay whether it’s active or not.\"}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"On Neon, compute doesn’t just autoscale - it can shut down entirely when there are no active connections and resume in ~350ms.\"}],\" Non-production environments consume zero compute while idle and spin back up instantly when needed, without wasting mindspace on manually pausing/resuming and also without wasting costs\"]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#426CE0] dark:border-blue-70 [\u0026_pre]:px-4 [\u0026_pre]:py-3 [\u0026_pre_code]:text-sm! [\u0026_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [\u0026_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[#426CE0] dark:text-blue-70\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 16 16\",\"className\":\"shrink-0\",\"children\":[\"$52:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0\",\"$52:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:1\"]}],[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase\",\"children\":\"info\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [\u0026_a]:rounded-sm [\u0026_li]:text-base [\u0026_li]:leading-snug [\u0026_li]:tracking-extra-tight [\u0026_ul]:my-0 [\u0026_ol]:my-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\